#%RAML 1.0 ResourceType

description: task log service entry point with <<task-name>>
usage: on an entry point that implements a task service entry point

(paged-collection):
displayName: <<task-name>> logs
post:
  is: [ entityCreation: { entityCreationType: TaskLogCreation, entityType: TaskLog, error: Error } ]
get:
  is: [ rfc7233Browsing: { entityType: TaskLog, error: Error } ]
